    "Owner": "NLM",
    "CoiStatement": "Authors' contributions: JL also contributed to data collection for this manuscript. FP, PL, GBB, and CGF have no conflicts to disclose with regard to this post-hoc analysis. JL is a consultant to Sanofi. All authors contributed to the conduct, data analysis/interpretation, and writing of this manuscript. The authors report no conflicts of interest.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "e6022"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": [
        {
